  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Padarthi Mohan Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 23 October, 2019 Author: Kongara Vijaya Lakshmi Bench: Kongara Vijaya Lakshmi Hon'Ble Smt. Justice Kongara Vijaya Lakshmi Criminal Petition No.6270 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners while denying the FIR allegations would submit that even if the prosecution case is accepted to be true, tobacco products would not fall within the definition of Section 3(j) of FSS Act and therefore, the police are not authorised to register the crime, investigate and file charge sheet and therefore, registration of the FIR is contrary to the provisions of FSS Act.",
